WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.461 --> 00:00:02.655
- I have never heard of this before. Ever.

00:00:02.655 --> 00:00:06.048
(upbeat music)

00:00:06.048 --> 00:00:08.080
- Is this a Japanese Will
Wonka sort of (beep)?

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.990
- We majored in art stuff.

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:11.778
So...

00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:13.891
- I'm imagining edible Legos.

00:00:13.891 --> 00:00:16.138
I'm actually really excited.

00:00:17.608 --> 00:00:19.720
Wait. This becomes a tentacle?

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:21.996
- Oh, my God. This one's
Coca-Cola flavored.

00:00:21.996 --> 00:00:24.644
- Move this goo in there.

00:00:24.644 --> 00:00:25.452
(candy snapping)

00:00:25.452 --> 00:00:27.240
- This kind of reminds
me of that Play-Doh kit

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:29.048
where you make the people's hair.

00:00:29.048 --> 00:00:30.206
- Aw, yeah.

00:00:30.206 --> 00:00:30.633
- [Girl in Pink] You have to have like

00:00:30.633 --> 00:00:32.143
nimble fingers for this.

00:00:32.143 --> 00:00:34.195
- [Girl in Dog T-shirt]
I'm like so surprised.

00:00:34.195 --> 00:00:36.282
- It looks like a Pintrest fail.

00:00:36.282 --> 00:00:39.329
- So, this is what the package looks like

00:00:39.329 --> 00:00:42.072
and this is what our product looks like.

00:00:42.072 --> 00:00:43.190
- Nailed it.

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:44.889
- [Girl lin Grey] Look at them
all. They're best friends.

00:00:44.889 --> 00:00:47.692
- I didn't expect there
to be so many steps

00:00:47.692 --> 00:00:48.972
to making this candy.

00:00:48.972 --> 00:00:52.839
- In America, it just comes
in the gummy bear shape.

00:00:54.133 --> 00:00:56.979
- Ooh. Ice cream-esque things.

00:00:56.979 --> 00:00:58.806
- (laughs) I'm excited about this one.

00:00:58.806 --> 00:01:01.091
- Kind of looks like the
candy world in Wreck It Ralph.

00:01:01.091 --> 00:01:01.904
- Oh, it does.

00:01:01.904 --> 00:01:04.108
- They're so little.

00:01:04.498 --> 00:01:06.039
- These are so cute.

00:01:06.039 --> 00:01:07.441
- This is measuring.

00:01:07.441 --> 00:01:09.371
This thing is a measuring tool.

00:01:09.371 --> 00:01:10.610
- I love that you can
decide for all of this.

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:11.829
I was just gonna wing it.

00:01:11.829 --> 00:01:14.105
- Ooh! It smells like cake.
- Mmm. This is good.

00:01:14.105 --> 00:01:16.096
- [Girl in Pink] Oh,
(beep). Look, it's icing up.

00:01:16.096 --> 00:01:17.917
- We're behind on the times, America.

00:01:17.917 --> 00:01:20.071
- Our toys are so dumb compared to this.

00:01:20.071 --> 00:01:22.143
- Oh, we squeeze it on here
and we do like the little--

00:01:22.143 --> 00:01:24.175
- Oh! That's awesome.

00:01:24.175 --> 00:01:26.552
- This is the perfect thing
for like having a friend over.

00:01:26.552 --> 00:01:27.547
- Cut the tip.

00:01:27.547 --> 00:01:28.848
(laughs)

00:01:28.848 --> 00:01:30.008
- [Girl in Grey] Oh, yeah.

00:01:30.008 --> 00:01:32.365
This is what Dairy Queen taught me.

00:01:32.365 --> 00:01:33.990
- [Girl in Purple] Oh, (beep).

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:34.782
(gasps)

00:01:34.782 --> 00:01:35.453
(laughs)

00:01:35.453 --> 00:01:37.007
- Ice cream it out.
- Yes.

00:01:37.007 --> 00:01:38.755
- Girl, that's kind of phallic. (laughs)

00:01:38.755 --> 00:01:39.750
- [Girl in Dog T-shirt] It was pretty.

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:40.815
- [Man in Red] You ruined everything.

00:01:40.815 --> 00:01:42.867
- Oh, wait. Is it not good?

00:01:42.867 --> 00:01:44.147
(laughs) Oh, no.

00:01:44.147 --> 00:01:45.589
- Is it good?
- It's pure sugar.

00:01:45.589 --> 00:01:46.890
That's great.
(laughs)

00:01:46.890 --> 00:01:48.718
- It tastes like wet sand.
(candy crunching)

00:01:48.718 --> 00:01:49.613
It looks great.

00:01:49.613 --> 00:01:51.574
Tastes like (beep).
- Mmm.

00:01:53.844 --> 00:01:55.418
- Wow.

00:01:55.418 --> 00:01:56.982
- Oh, God. The directions are--

00:01:56.982 --> 00:01:58.364
- There's so many directions.

00:01:58.364 --> 00:02:00.406
- I feel like it's just
moulding them though, right?

00:02:00.406 --> 00:02:02.377
Like, we don't have that many options.

00:02:02.377 --> 00:02:04.003
- It's gonna taste like toothpaste.

00:02:04.003 --> 00:02:04.836
- Where is this?

00:02:04.836 --> 00:02:05.851
- Orange is this square.

00:02:05.851 --> 00:02:07.844
- Which orange? Big one or little one?

00:02:07.844 --> 00:02:08.736
- [Girl in Dog T-shirt] This one?

00:02:08.736 --> 00:02:09.833
- [Man in Red] This
looks like the broccoli.

00:02:09.833 --> 00:02:11.235
- This is broccoli?

00:02:11.235 --> 00:02:12.760
- We gotta put water in there, right?

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:14.506
- I know. I just don't know how much.

00:02:14.506 --> 00:02:17.716
- Pink. Pink goes in the pineapple thing.

00:02:17.716 --> 00:02:20.115
- Blue is supposed to go in here, I think.

00:02:20.115 --> 00:02:21.983
- Yes, because the grey goes in--

00:02:21.983 --> 00:02:23.750
- No, wait. This says
the red goes in there.

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:24.624
- What?

00:02:24.624 --> 00:02:25.661
- You know what? I think
the blue goes in there

00:02:25.661 --> 00:02:27.123
and then the red goes in there.

00:02:27.123 --> 00:02:28.546
Oh! They're becoming gelatinous.

00:02:28.546 --> 00:02:30.150
I want this to look good.

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:31.918
If this looks bad, I'm gonna cry.

00:02:31.918 --> 00:02:32.690
- [Girl in Dog T-shirt] Ease it out--

00:02:32.690 --> 00:02:33.504
Oh, God.

00:02:33.504 --> 00:02:34.055
- [Man in Red] Oh, no.

00:02:34.055 --> 00:02:34.983
- [Girl in Glasses]
He's a little deformed,

00:02:34.983 --> 00:02:36.262
but that's okay.

00:02:36.262 --> 00:02:37.542
- [Girl in Dog T-shirt]
It looks like snot.

00:02:37.542 --> 00:02:38.680
- The whole spectrum of snot.

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:40.631
- [Girl in Grey] I think
we did pretty well.

00:02:40.631 --> 00:02:41.768
- [Girl in Glasses] I
think that we killed it.

00:02:41.768 --> 00:02:43.251
We crushed it, it looks like there.

00:02:43.251 --> 00:02:45.283
- In our defense, we don't speak Japanese

00:02:45.283 --> 00:02:46.299
and it's really hard.

00:02:46.299 --> 00:02:47.884
- If I had the time set aside,

00:02:47.884 --> 00:02:50.159
I feel I could do a really good job.

00:02:50.159 --> 00:02:51.785
This one was a rough one.

00:02:51.785 --> 00:02:55.036
- Props to Japan because if I was a parent

00:02:55.036 --> 00:02:56.845
and you're gonna give me candy,

00:02:56.845 --> 00:02:59.444
at least give them a candy
that will keep them occupied

00:02:59.444 --> 00:03:00.804
for like a half an hour.

00:03:00.804 --> 00:03:02.602
That's a great idea.

